OL,3,GNEWSATerror suspect teen denies making
OL,4,Aexplosives
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager accused of making explosives
OL,7,Fhas denied a series of terror offences.
OL,9,FMario Weresi, from Norwich, is also
OL,10,Faccused of possessing a firearm,
OL,11,Fdistributing terror manuals and
OL,12,Fstirring up racial hatred.
OL,14,FThe 18-year-old pleaded not guilty to
OL,15,F15 offences at the Old Bailey in London
OL,16,Fearlier and is due to stand trial next
OL,17,Fyear.
OL,19,FHowever, Weresi admitted one charge of
OL,20,Fcreating deepfake images of teenage
OL,21,Fgirls.
